{"2292540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmic Waves", "steam_appid": 2292540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Waves</strong> puts an entirely new spin on block destruction – the classic arcade genre made popular by games such as Breakout and Arkanoid. It merges traditional brick-breaking elements, including different block types and pickups, with many cool new features that bring greater depth, skill, and excitement to every bounce, rebound, and ricochet! <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/0f41c8c663118f20b086030fd44e6d01.poster.avif?t=1777363076\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/0f41c8c663118f20b086030fd44e6d01.webm?t=1777363076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/0f41c8c663118f20b086030fd44e6d01.mp4?t=1777363076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new dynamic in ball control:</strong> Utilise up to four energy towers and release force waves capable of changing a ball’s momentum, trajectory, and power  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/cbd8f6d9499109402a88ea93822833ef.poster.avif?t=1777363076\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/cbd8f6d9499109402a88ea93822833ef.webm?t=1777363076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/cbd8f6d9499109402a88ea93822833ef.mp4?t=1777363076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super-powered paddle action:</strong> Boost your brick-breaking with a range of special weapons, and use unlockable gadgets to further enhance paddle capabilities   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/f1fdbebacddb9ee9bc26f1b087deff08.poster.avif?t=1777363076\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/f1fdbebacddb9ee9bc26f1b087deff08.webm?t=1777363076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/f1fdbebacddb9ee9bc26f1b087deff08.mp4?t=1777363076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brick-breaking with a story:</strong> Join a duo of heroic wolves and their robot sidekick as they travel through space and face animal antagonists in a light-hearted adventure </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/fe6a23d1c6da4ce302e6396dbd3c609a.avif?t=1777363076\" width=612 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Station: </strong>Collect resources extracted from broken blocks or destroyed enemies and use them to increase weapon power, tower range, paddle durability and much more </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta